  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch leads one group of Fang Yuan’s subordinates. He is a rank eight snowman Gu Immortal. He shouts that they are the subordinates of Yellow Earth Sage Gu Yue Fang Yuan, that they are here to help, and that they are here to kill the Green Lotus Gu Immortals. Together with Mu Cha Lang and Qing Hao Zi, Green Lotus has eight people. Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch’s group numbers over twenty, and nine of them are rank eight Gu Immortals. On Green Lotus’s side, only Mu Cha Lang, Qing Hao Zi, and Old Forest Moss have rank eight cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        2157
      ],
